    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48076" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θελ-ητής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦ</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one
				who wills</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλέους</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Mi.</u>
				7.18
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>wizard</i> (by confusion of Hebr. '<i>ōbh</i>
			'necromancer' with '<i>ōbheh</i> 'wishing'), <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>4 Ki.</u>
				21.6
			</span></i>; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγγαστ ρίμυθος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Cyr.
			</span></i></div>
